  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "21",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOB 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Job answered and said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hear diligently my speech, and let this be your consolations.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suffer me that I may speak; and after that I have spoken, mock on.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As for me,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.21.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.21.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my complaint to man? and if",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it were so",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.21.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.21.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", why should not my spirit be troubled?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mark me, and be astonished, and lay",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "your",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.21.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.21.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hand upon",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "your",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.21.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.21.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mouth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Even when I remember I am afraid, and trembling taketh hold on my flesh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wherefore do the wicked live, become old, yea, are mighty in power?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Their seed is established in their sight with them, and their offspring before their eyes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Their houses",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.21.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.21.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "safe from fear, neither",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.21.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.21.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the rod of God upon them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Their bull gendereth, and faileth not; their cow calveth, and casteth not her calf.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They send forth their little ones like a flock, and their children dance.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They take the timbrel and harp, and rejoice at the sound of the organ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They spend their days in wealth, and in a moment go down to the grave.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore they say unto God, Depart from us; for we desire not the knowledge of thy ways.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.21.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.21.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the Almighty, that we should serve him? and what profit should we have, if we pray unto him?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lo, their good",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.21.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.21.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not in their hand: the counsel of the wicked is far from me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How oft is the candle of the wicked put out! and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "how oft",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.21.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.21.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cometh their destruction upon them!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "God",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.21.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.21.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "distributeth sorrows in his anger.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They are as stubble before the wind, and as chaff that the storm carrieth away.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God layeth up his iniquity for his children: he rewardeth him, and he shall know",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.21.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.21.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His eyes shall see his destruction, and he shall drink of the wrath of the Almighty.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For what pleasure",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "hath",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.21.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.21.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he in his house after him, when the number of his months is cut off in the midst?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shall",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "any",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.21.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.21.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "teach God knowledge? seeing he judgeth those that are high.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "One dieth in his full strength, being wholly at ease and quiet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His breasts are full of milk, and his bones are moistened with marrow.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And another dieth in the bitterness of his soul, and never eateth with pleasure.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall lie down alike in the dust, and the worms shall cover them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, I know your thoughts, and the devices",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.21.27",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.21.27"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ye wrongfully imagine against me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For ye say, Where",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.21.28",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.21.28"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the house of the prince? and where",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.21.28",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.21.28"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the dwelling places of the wicked?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Have ye not asked them that go by the way? and do ye not know their tokens,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That the wicked is reserved to the day of destruction? they shall be brought forth to the day of wrath.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who shall declare his way to his face? and who shall repay him",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "what",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.21.31",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.21.31"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he hath done?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yet shall he be brought to the grave, and shall remain in the tomb.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The clods of the valley shall be sweet unto him, and every man shall draw after him, as",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.21.33",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.21.33"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "innumerable before him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 21:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How then comfort ye me in vain, seeing in your answers there remaineth falsehood?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.21.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.21.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
